      "content": "the survey is the main issue though. there's an old fence and a small shed that are clearly encroaching on our property line, but the digital mapping barely registers them. if the board sees a discrepancy between the physical encroachment and the official records, they might deny the mixed-use request on the grounds of non-compliance. how can i argue that these small, unrecorded encroachments shouldn't block the whole reclassification?",
